l revenue.","The top line has compounded at +53% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -6% against a 9% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, with gross margins sitting at 47%.","The company is burning through $25M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.0\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and thin -0.0\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 30% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.4) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Beneish M-Score flags potential earnings manipulation \u2014 a question of whether the reported numbers can be trusted","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Healthcare peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Vireo Growth Inc. (VREOF) Stock Price, News, Quote & History - Yahoo! Finance Canada","source":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE1KcUdxTEJoLWljM2J1emhvZ2I3QUJPb3ZzMENFYUxjNFUtSjhvVWl3S0RqeTN0cW1DNE52YlBsLWpPRlhvM3VCSDFlTFhwZm5vS3dB?oc=5","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794297600.0,"origin":"google_news_ticker","tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Vireo Growth Inc. (VREO.CN) Seasonal Returns Chart - Yahoo Finance - Yahoo! Finance Canada","source":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE9SSzZrSHQ5bzE3MktVWF9UdU1lelg0NlJXOEJ1Zi12bDFuaUluUHUzSXNPSzNTSndjN1JORmNVWnFzTDJTbGlDYi1sYkItY3EzVzhaQ2JlLXJtY2o4MXFhNEJjbU1SQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794527687.0,"origin":"google_news_ticker","tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Vireo Growth Inc. Announces Third Quarter 2026 Results - Yahoo Finance","source":"Yahoo Finance","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOYkgzMXlwTzRGV3RCSm5LVGliUnNLQ0tybUczUTNHaVJPXzhBM2NEcFlDdmRmeUNKTHBoT0w5Tlp1STZIRXVoMC1jWjhXeVlwRXlEUXpycWotd2QyVTV5MWg0UFAyZ2V5bzVhSk5RVGFjWmNnNTlGZmprOGtiVXlmcXJFR2tQYzRBUDIwY0xCXzBmYllpRGFfSHA2QVR1QQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794310200.0,"origin":"google_news_ticker","tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Vireo Growth Inc. Completes Acquisition of FLU